#: simple_commands.py:31
msgid ""
"Follow these steps:\n"
"\n"
"1. Add this bot to a group\n"
"2. In the group, start a new game with /new or join an already running game "
"with /join\n"
"3. After at least two players have joined, start the game with /start\n"
"4. Type the bot's username into your chat box and hit <b>space</b>, or "
"click the <code>via @the bot's username</code> text next to messages. You "
"will see your cards (some greyed out), any extra options like drawing, and "
"a <b>?</b> to see the current game state. The <b>greyed out cards</b> are "
"those you <b>can not play</b> at the moment. Tap an option to execute the "
"selected action.\n"
"Players can join the game at any time. To leave a game, use /leave. Use "
"/notify_me to receive a private message when a new game is started.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Language</b> and other settings: /settings\n"
"Other commands (only game creator):\n"
"/close - Close lobby\n"
"/open - Open lobby\n"
"/kill - Terminate the game\n"
"/kick - Select a player to kick by replying to him or her\n"
"/enable_translations - Translate relevant texts into all languages spoken "
"in a game\n"
"/disable_translations - Use English for those texts\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi amallarni bajaring:\n"
"\n"
"1. Ushbu botni guruhga qo'shing\n"
"2. Guruhda /new bilan yangi o‘yinni boshlang yoki /join bilan allaqachon "
"ishlayotgan o‘yinga qo‘shiling\n"
"3. Kamida ikkita o‘yinchi qo‘shilgandan so‘ng, o‘yinni /start bilan "
"boshlang\n"
"4. Chat maydoniga <code>@the bot's username</code> so‘zini kiriting va "
"<b>bo‘sh joy</b> tugmasini bosingyoki xabarlar yonidagi <code>@the bot's "
"username orqali</code> matnni bosing.Siz kartalaringizni (ba'zilari kul "
"rangda), koʻtarish kabi qoʻshimchavariantlarni va <b>?</b> joriy oʻyin "
"holatini koʻrish uchun.<b>Kulrang kartalar</b> - bu siz <b>hozir oʻynay "
"olmaydigan</b> kartalar.Tanlangan amalni bajarish uchun variantni bosing.\n"
"Oʻyinchilar oʻyinga istalgan vaqtda qoʻshilishlari mumkin.Oʻyinni tark "
"etish uchun /leave dan foydalaning.Yangi oʻyin boshlanganda shaxsiy xabar "
"olish uchun /notify_me dan foydalaning.\n"
"\n"
"Til va boshqa sozlamalar: /settings\n"
"Boshqa buyruqlar (faqat oʻyin yaratuvchisi uchun):/close - Lobbini yopish\n"
"/open - Lobbini ochish\n"
"/kill - Oʻyinni tugatish\n"
"/kick - Tepadigan oʻyinchiga javob berish orqali uni tanlash\n"
"/enable_translations - Tegishli matnlarni o'yinda aytiladigan barcha "
"tillarga tarjima qilish\n"
"/disable_translations - Ushbu matnlar uchun ingliz tilidan foydalaning\n"
"\n"

#: simple_commands.py:70
msgid ""
"This UNO bot has three game modes: Classic, Sanic and Wild.\n"
"\n"
" 🎻 The Classic mode uses the conventional UNO deck and there is no auto skip.\n"
" 🚀 The Sanic mode uses the conventional UNO deck and the bot automatically skips a player if he/she takes too long to play its turn\n"
" 🐉 The Wild mode uses a deck with more special cards, less number variety and no auto skip.\n"
"\n"
"To change the game mode, the GAME CREATOR has to type the bot nickname and a space, just like when playing a card, and all gamemode options should appear."
msgstr ""
"Bu UNO botida uchta oʻyin rejimi bor: Klassik, Sanik va Wild.\n"
"\n"
" 🎻 Klassik rejim oddiy UNO dastasidan foydalanadi va avtomatik oʻtkazib yuborish yoʻq.\n"
" 🚀 Sanik rejimi oddiy UNO dastasidan foydalanadi va oʻyinchi navbatini oʻynashga juda koʻp vaqt sarflasa, bot uni avtomatik ravishda oʻtkazib yuboradi\n"
" 🐉 Wild rejimi koʻproq maxsus kartalar va kamroq raqam turlariga ega dastadan foydalanadi, avtomatik oʻtkazib yuborish yoʻq.\n"
"\n"
"Oʻyin rejimini oʻzgartirish uchun OʻYIN YARATUVCHISI xuddi karta oʻynagandek bot nomini va boʻsh joy yozishi kerak, shunda barcha oʻyin rejimi variantlari paydo boʻladi."

